"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279128044,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkxMjgwNDQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/confirmed","name":"confirmed","color":"aaddaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-06-19T22:13:10Z","updated_at":"2026-07-20T23:37:53Z","closed_at":"2026-07-20T23:37:53Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nFound in v4.7.stable.mono.official [5b4e0cb0f]\n\nReproducable in: \n- v4.7.beta5.official [bbd3f43b5]\n- v4.7.beta1.official [1c8cc9e7e]\n\nNot reproducable in: \n- v4.6.stable.mono.official [89cea1439]\n- v4.6.3.stable.official [7d41c59c4]\n- v4.7.dev1.official [bf95b6258]\n- v4.7.dev2.official [778cf54da]\n- v4.7.dev5.official [a8643700c]\n\nBoth Vulkan and D3D12 renderer are susceptible.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.stable.mono - Windows 10 (build 19044) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 7700 XT (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 32.0.31007.5012) - AMD Ryzen 7 5800X 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 31.92 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf you set a render scale different from 1.0 with FXAA/SMAA enabled and MSAA 2D enabled, the renderer freezes and a bunch of errors relating to framebuffers are output to the console. This is particularly amplified with shaders that access the screen texture. FSR 1.0 and FSR 2.2 upscaling is not affected. \n\n_Demonstration using my existing project with screen texture shaders._\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fdde8703-0cbe-4402-9676-7d7168533e38\n\n_The MRP demo project showcasing the issue._\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e7a064b5-8e9b-4f2d-ad1a-7e13d922f547\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Set `rendering/anti_aliasing/quality/msaa_2d` to 2x, 4x, or 8x\n- Set `rendering/anti_aliasing/quality/screen_space_aa` to FXAA or SMAA\n- Set `rendering/scaling_3d/mode` to Nearest or Bilinear\n- Set `rendering/scaling_3d/scale` to anything other than 1.0\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nThis project provides a simple test scene and a small interface that lets you modify the necessary settings from the reproduction steps. The 3D scene setup doesn't matter, and this will occur in an empty 3D scene too.\n\n[gd4.7-bugdemo.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29152130/gd4.7-bugdemo.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120470/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120470/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}